  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I literally cannot type to my friends anymore because the new chatbox doesn't have the text field attached to the keyboard. I have to guess what I'm typing and try to look down, plus the keyboard IS NOT SET TO ALWAYS ON TOP SO I CANT EVEN SEARCH FOR SETTINGS TO TRY TO TURN THIS DAMN THING OFF!!!!\n\nThis is literally the worst change to the UI ever. There was nothing wrong with the old chatbox. Now I cannot even communicate with anyone anymore because I'm disabled, have to lay down, and cannot use the god damn keyboard or see the text field without having to either stand up or get up.",
